  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7905401",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790540101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790540101": {
            "id": "790540101",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Why are you up here yourself? There isn't even a rail line here, and it's way high up at the very edge of the Mirage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540102"
            ]
          },
          "790540102": {
            "id": "790540102",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "People rarely come here. Even Idyia... Heh, I doubt she even knows this place exists.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540103"
            ]
          },
          "790540103": {
            "id": "790540103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So if there's nothing here, why are you here, Jeroney?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540104"
            ]
          },
          "790540104": {
            "id": "790540104",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "I just came out for a little fresh air... Hey, don't give me that \"you ran away from home after arguing with Ferdinand again\" look!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540105"
            ]
          },
          "790540105": {
            "id": "790540105",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Come on, there really wasn't an argument. I'm just taking a stroll out of, well, I don't know, personal interest!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540106"
            ]
          },
          "790540106": {
            "id": "790540106",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "I suppose you already knew that the Choo-Choo Cart was my idea. At that time, I was only thinking: What's something that could easily reach great heights...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540107"
            ]
          },
          "790540107": {
            "id": "790540107",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "So I... So Jeroney brainstormed the Choo-Choo Cart and the rails, all for the love of the sky and heights.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540108"
            ]
          },
          "790540108": {
            "id": "790540108",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Sounds silly, doesn't it? I remember Inazuma has a saying that goes something like, \"only idiots and smoke like to rise up high\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540111"
            ]
          },
          "790540111": {
            "id": "790540111",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "But it can only exist in the Veluriyam Mirage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540112"
            ]
          },
          "790540112": {
            "id": "790540112",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "...Forget it, let's not talk about it. I also came here to stargaze.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540113"
            ]
          },
          "790540113": {
            "id": "790540113",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "I know the stars here are merely an ephemeral shadow from outside the Mirage, but they're pretty enough for me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540114"
            ]
          },
          "790540114": {
            "id": "790540114",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Every night when I look upon the starry sky... I feel so peaceful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540115"
            ]
          },
          "790540115": {
            "id": "790540115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The one who loves the starry sky... is it Jeroney...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540116"
            ]
          },
          "790540116": {
            "id": "790540116",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "But whoever sees a starry sky like that couldn't help but fall in love with it. If only I could see the stars in the daytime...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540117"
            ]
          },
          "790540117": {
            "id": "790540117",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Or even better, if I didn't have to climb up here every day!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540118"
            ]
          },
          "790540118": {
            "id": "790540118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait! That's possible! Paimon's got an idea!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540119"
            ]
          },
          "790540119": {
            "id": "790540119",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Huh? Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540120"
            ]
          },
          "790540120": {
            "id": "790540120",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We can just take a photo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540121"
            ]
          },
          "790540121": {
            "id": "790540121",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Pho... Photo? That sounds like some advanced technology.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540122"
            ]
          },
          "790540122": {
            "id": "790540122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, why don't we take a photo of the starry sky for Jeroney?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540123"
            ]
          },
          "790540123": {
            "id": "790540123",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Can you really do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540124"
            ]
          },
          "790540124": {
            "id": "790540124",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Of course you can!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540125"
            ]
          },
          "790540125": {
            "id": "790540125",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... Paimon isn't sure of any good spots to take pictures of the starry night...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540126"
            ]
          },
          "790540126": {
            "id": "790540126",
            "speakerId": 13249,
            "speakerName": "Jeroney",
            "text": "Here! At night, on the platform here, you can see the most beautiful starscape! That's the reason I came here in the first place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790540127"
            ]
          },
          "790540127": {
            "id": "790540127",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really? Great! Jeroney, you just wait for our photo!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7905402",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until night (19:00 – 05:00)",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
